{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-30T21:44:54.774Z","data":{"text":"Task 3 complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nI removed the verification path from the inbox/dispatch layer and moved the check and after-landing notes onto the land card:\n\n- **`DispatchKind`** now has only `approval | halt | land`; `verifyItems`, `VerifyCard`, `verifyCard`, and `verifyLines` are gone, `KIND_RANK` lost `verify`, and `readDispatchItems` no longer reads the overview's pending verifications.\n- **`LandCard`** gained `check` (via `readCheckCommand` on the proposal frontmatter) and `afterLanding` (via `parseHumanSteps`), printed after the squash message as `check:` and `after landing:`.\n- **`cardKeys`** dropped the `check`/`verified` verbs, so those commands surface as manual.\n- **`NeedsYouKind`**, `inbox-projection.ts`, `inbox-text.ts`, and the UI labels lost the two verification kinds.\n- **`report-inbox-wait.ts`** keeps a local `DispatchKind | 'verify'` type for old wait logs and stays within the 250-line budget.\n- Updated the five listed tests and added `tests/dispatch-no-verify.test.ts` covering \"Each kind\", \"Verify keys\", \"Archived change with after-landing steps\", and \"Verify card\".\n\nBoth verifies pass:\n- `node --import tsx --test tests/dispatch-no-verify.test.ts` → 4/4 pass\n- `pnpm verify` → typechecks, build, full suite (2842 tests) and lint green\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/125-checks-osq-runs/.run/results/3.md`."}}
